ber":6,"title":{"value":"Fonte di calore latente","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A seemingly run-of-the mill hit-and-run turns into anything but when Togusa investigates. While in Tokyo, he discovers a secret from the past the GSDF is trying to keep hidden deep underground.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-03-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pkJEreDZ8iuvz7nbguSHgmS9KTH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pkJEreDZ8iuvz7nbguSHgmS9KTH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1095/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"56511","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Folli ideologie indagini su un paese perduto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Plans have been leaked to terrorists that the plutonium recovered from the underground nuclear facility in Tokyo is to be moved. Section 9 is called in to ensure the plutonium reaches its destination, and Gohda is there again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-04-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wjsN3188DxknFZ4RevMSCbHDT7R.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wjsN3188DxknFZ4RevMSCbHDT7R.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1095/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"56512","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Cena vegetariana","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While on a stakeout of a Taiwanese vegetarian restaurant, Section 9 finds out that someone is pulling strings and feeding misinformation to the Public Safety Sections.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-04-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXMCVEmlsFtDxMkjBCbATTt0Iw2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXMCVEmlsFtDxMkjBCbATTt0Iw2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1095/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"56513","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Una speranza chiamata disperazione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Tachikomas and the Major continue to investigate Gohda and his motives, while the rest of Section 9 are out to stop a string of suicide bombings.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jRNu6YSLST4WeIs2P2Jim2NW68x.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jRNu6YSLST4WeIs2P2Jim2NW68x.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1095/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"56514","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Un uomo che può impazzire","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Togusa is brought up on charges after he becomes involved with a murder while off duty. But during the course of the trial, it becomes clear who the attorney is really after.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7QiqbeHkrhtjXonNcAHpnuyN2aM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7QiqbeHkrhtjXonNcAHpnuyN2aM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/1095/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"56515","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Labirinto d'erba","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While field testing new recruits, the Major finds herself hacked, and an old woman tells her a story from her past.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2004-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xyIpdYw96AviH31BX4ZYOGPsuxO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyIpdYw96AviH31BX4ZYOGPsuxO.jpg","language":"xx"}],